The Spanish–German dictionary data in spa-deu.json is derived from:

1. FreeDict spa-deu (Ding-based), available from https://freedict.org/
   Upstream source used for conversion:
     https://download.freedict.org/dictionaries/spa-deu/
   FreeDict dictionaries are free software; see the upstream COPYING file from
   the spa-deu source package for the precise license terms of the original TEI
   data.

2. WikDict español→Deutsch (es-de), available from https://www.wikdict.com/
   Download (SQLite):
     https://download.wikdict.com/dictionaries/sqlite/2/es-de.sqlite3
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
     https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
   WikDict is built from Wiktionary; attribute WikDict and the Wiktionary
   contributors. Share adaptations under the same CC BY-SA terms.

Merge policy used by cmd/convertdict: FreeDict entries win on shared lemmas;
WikDict contributes only lemmas FreeDict does not already contain. Affix rows
(headwords starting or ending with "-") from WikDict are dropped.
